Answer each question ID exactly once in English and Brazilian Portuguese, at most two sentences per answer. Use relevant fact_ids. The verified source meanings are supplied so this measures faithful prose/translation, not independent source discovery. Preserve parent/child, depth, before/after and normal-versus-exception conditions. Uncertainty fields express unavailable proof, not positive guarantees. Do not invent callback success, test execution or isolation.

